  ('2e5af220-49a6-5701-a1fc-93fdd39cdde0', '8ab26caf-d774-51fe-9234-6c1bdc2e9756', $gs$Have I understood my pre-salvation condition as merely legal guilt, without this passage’s relational dimension?$gs$, 4),
  ('2804b19a-f883-5150-93a7-fcb043eeaf2b', '8ab26caf-d774-51fe-9234-6c1bdc2e9756', $gs$How does thinking of sin as relational separation, not just legal violation, change how I understand salvation?$gs$, 5),
  ('c8ef544f-1aa8-5478-b739-a681a68c7e52', '8ab26caf-d774-51fe-9234-6c1bdc2e9756', $gs$What does it mean to me that God’s “face” was hidden, and now, in Christ, is genuinely turned toward me?$gs$, 6),
  ('fb777597-d1b5-596a-b47b-f7333867ca75', '8ab26caf-d774-51fe-9234-6c1bdc2e9756', $gs$How might this relational understanding shape how I talk about salvation with someone who feels distant from God?$gs$, 7),
  ('5854cd37-9bed-5feb-8ba0-b171aadc19c1', '8ab26caf-d774-51fe-9234-6c1bdc2e9756', $gs$What relationship in my own life could help me understand this kind of genuine, painful separation?$gs$, 8)
on conflict (id) do nothing;
