  ('116a142e-53f8-54ae-abf7-cb1ac405dc59', '270606b7-1a42-5995-8d45-da2d9db31a4d', $gs$How does understanding someone’s present, not merely future, exposure to judgment affect my urgency to share the gospel?$gs$, 5),
  ('a87815a7-7bf1-51fb-a22f-6d7e8755c4e5', '270606b7-1a42-5995-8d45-da2d9db31a4d', $gs$Do I hold this truth with appropriate seriousness while avoiding harsh, condemning judgment of my own?$gs$, 6),
  ('5dcc5a89-0390-5590-8ad5-077e79398235', '270606b7-1a42-5995-8d45-da2d9db31a4d', $gs$What has kept me from having an urgent, genuine gospel conversation with someone I care about?$gs$, 7),
  ('60e6ef27-38e4-5c8d-ad54-4460684044dc', '270606b7-1a42-5995-8d45-da2d9db31a4d', $gs$How can I communicate this sobering reality with both honesty and genuine compassion together?$gs$, 8)
on conflict (id) do nothing;
