  ('8ffc7698-f901-5023-8de1-1118970a25ba', '0bb515cb-07b5-5b5d-8826-ee485b5b2e3c', $gs$How does trusting the Spirit’s genuine, convicting work change the pressure I feel in gospel conversations?$gs$, 5),
  ('1ba28d09-1240-50b4-8bce-3e4d67008f63', '0bb515cb-07b5-5b5d-8826-ee485b5b2e3c', $gs$Have I witnessed the Spirit’s conviction at work in someone’s life, even before they fully responded?$gs$, 6),
  ('e125817b-b21a-5ee9-ae17-bd86d3d66391', '0bb515cb-07b5-5b5d-8826-ee485b5b2e3c', $gs$What would it look like to speak faithfully while genuinely trusting God with the actual outcome?$gs$, 7),
  ('c218d25b-0e26-51fd-bff1-85be60f0d2b4', '0bb515cb-07b5-5b5d-8826-ee485b5b2e3c', $gs$How can I remain diligent and clear in my witness while releasing this false, personal burden?$gs$, 8)
on conflict (id) do nothing;
