  ('636899a7-e5ff-5178-a337-5e85ac68dacd', 'e7942d9b-a207-536f-b703-1f1ec1e63209', $gs$How does recognizing sin’s enslaving power change how I view someone caught in a destructive pattern?$gs$, 5),
  ('f67f015a-6fa5-5f89-a748-75d55fd7e705', 'e7942d9b-a207-536f-b703-1f1ec1e63209', $gs$What false confidence in willpower alone have I carried, either for myself or in how I’ve counseled others?$gs$, 6),
  ('295cc428-9090-54eb-a687-4fd4ae817243', 'e7942d9b-a207-536f-b703-1f1ec1e63209', $gs$How does Christ’s liberating work differ from merely offering better advice or moral encouragement?$gs$, 7),
  ('b16c4c78-88bb-59da-9e52-af3ea2db2368', 'e7942d9b-a207-536f-b703-1f1ec1e63209', $gs$Who do I know who might need to hear that genuine freedom, not just better effort, is what they actually need?$gs$, 8)
on conflict (id) do nothing;
