  ('3926e6ba-6ece-5e65-b4e4-a2d25671e013', 'b2db92c9-f617-566a-8888-714734b61ee4', $gs$Do I genuinely feel compassion for the lost, or has my understanding remained merely theological and detached?$gs$, 4),
  ('083ef400-2a1c-5079-b107-0c3092fc1453', 'b2db92c9-f617-566a-8888-714734b61ee4', $gs$Have I ever treated evangelism as an obligation or project rather than genuine, compassionate love for a person?$gs$, 5),
  ('3d5243b6-1df5-578d-b17d-e2fa3a9fb74e', 'b2db92c9-f617-566a-8888-714734b61ee4', $gs$How does seeing someone as “weary and scattered,” not merely as a project, change how I approach them?$gs$, 6),
  ('ea1b4de2-e25f-58b1-9e32-4ba56ca76621', 'b2db92c9-f617-566a-8888-714734b61ee4', $gs$Who in my life could I begin viewing through this lens of genuine, Christlike compassion this week?$gs$, 7),
  ('f4560735-f799-5f88-a45d-9c11f92127ef', 'b2db92c9-f617-566a-8888-714734b61ee4', $gs$How can I hold honest truth about sin together with this same, genuine tenderness Christ modeled?$gs$, 8)
on conflict (id) do nothing;
