  ('a79a1e73-9fd0-51f8-8f34-a9d8dea89ebf', 'ffd48adf-cc07-5271-be9c-72f8d8bd3e63', $gs$Have I understood Christ’s existence as beginning at His birth, rather than this passage’s revelation of eternal, prior existence?$gs$, 4),
  ('cf970783-96f1-533c-b140-67c99fa7b56d', 'ffd48adf-cc07-5271-be9c-72f8d8bd3e63', $gs$How does recognizing this eternal existence deepen my appreciation for the humility of the incarnation?$gs$, 5),
  ('d0fdc0da-ba80-5c0a-8d74-5ebdc2181100', 'ffd48adf-cc07-5271-be9c-72f8d8bd3e63', $gs$What does it mean to me that the One who created all things chose to enter His own creation as a human being?$gs$, 6),
  ('ce010f16-d54c-5abf-8793-0b737eeb1289', 'ffd48adf-cc07-5271-be9c-72f8d8bd3e63', $gs$How might this truth shape my own worship of Christ as genuinely, eternally divine?$gs$, 7),
  ('dfd2f014-ff7b-5331-942c-e916cb157f4e', 'ffd48adf-cc07-5271-be9c-72f8d8bd3e63', $gs$What questions do I still have about how to understand this eternal, yet incarnate, reality?$gs$, 8)
on conflict (id) do nothing;
