  ('05ea7d3a-4700-5ee9-9338-effb8ee78731', '30e612e3-1277-56a2-b8c2-14355aea956b', $gs$What difference does it make that my High Priest genuinely understands, from real experience, what temptation feels like?$gs$, 6),
