  ('57bbb47e-6ea5-5620-b86a-ce55a80fce3d', 'ab7f90f7-bff8-54d2-9c04-c7114e4b658d', $gs$How does understanding the resurrection as historical proof strengthen my own confidence in the gospel’s truth?$gs$, 5),
  ('4bfde72b-efd3-5cea-b77c-6d0ae55167dd', 'ab7f90f7-bff8-54d2-9c04-c7114e4b658d', $gs$What hope do I draw from the promise that my own resurrection will follow this same, “firstfruits” pattern?$gs$, 6),
  ('cd3a1d26-370b-515f-a025-254483abd760', 'ab7f90f7-bff8-54d2-9c04-c7114e4b658d', $gs$How would I explain the resurrection’s evidential significance to someone skeptical of its historical reality?$gs$, 7),
  ('e9441cc9-f476-5ffc-8883-beb38ba5d4a4', 'ab7f90f7-bff8-54d2-9c04-c7114e4b658d', $gs$What questions do I still have about the nature of the resurrected, yet still physical, body?$gs$, 8)
