  ('c799dbf0-bb0e-51bc-aa7c-5f5813c2485f', 'f6cc095a-1c77-562b-8b83-8f0de9104fa3', $gs$Have I approached Christ primarily as a helpful teacher, rather than genuinely, personally as my Savior?$gs$, 4),
  ('0d657f9e-2feb-59ff-8bfe-027566ab8200', 'f6cc095a-1c77-562b-8b83-8f0de9104fa3', $gs$What does it mean to me, specifically, that I genuinely needed rescue, not merely instruction or example?$gs$, 5),
  ('94274c88-5844-563c-901f-921652b6ec4a', 'f6cc095a-1c77-562b-8b83-8f0de9104fa3', $gs$How does understanding Christ’s ongoing saving work — not just a past moment — shape my daily dependence on Him?$gs$, 6),
  ('0c909bf9-9bc4-5299-9132-c1f0dc3fd18f', 'f6cc095a-1c77-562b-8b83-8f0de9104fa3', $gs$What area of my life do I currently need to genuinely entrust to Christ as Savior, not merely admire from a distance?$gs$, 7),
  ('391a707a-189b-552f-b031-6a77d9c99a03', 'f6cc095a-1c77-562b-8b83-8f0de9104fa3', $gs$How would I explain to someone why “Savior” is a more accurate title than merely “good teacher” or “example”?$gs$, 8)
on conflict (id) do nothing;
