  ('a64c932c-dfe2-56eb-bd4a-c87a347fa4cd', '0ea06a78-6bdf-5677-b338-bb9cadee2a62', $gs$Have I confessed Christ as Savior while withholding genuine submission to Him as Lord in specific areas of my life?$gs$, 4),
  ('83056a21-d3ba-5441-b0f7-6bb3d7b9b0d7', '0ea06a78-6bdf-5677-b338-bb9cadee2a62', $gs$What specific area of my life — finances, relationships, ambition — do I still struggle to genuinely surrender to Christ?$gs$, 5),
  ('6858962a-75ff-53e6-925e-68efa6a0b3f1', '0ea06a78-6bdf-5677-b338-bb9cadee2a62', $gs$How does understanding lordship as ongoing surrender, not one-time confession, change how I approach obedience?$gs$, 6),
  ('c6807d7b-4498-5347-9289-2b1c3dd316d4', '0ea06a78-6bdf-5677-b338-bb9cadee2a62', $gs$What would it look like to take one, specific step of surrender in this area this week?$gs$, 7),
  ('3cf782fd-9781-5f2d-a442-14d3f8421eb9', '0ea06a78-6bdf-5677-b338-bb9cadee2a62', $gs$How can I hold genuine grace for incomplete surrender while still pursuing this ongoing posture of submission?$gs$, 8)
