  ('0f713bfd-f91c-54c4-8962-604b7d19519e', 'fca33890-1adc-585c-8875-b15c6761b0a2', $gs$How often do I genuinely consider Christ’s promised, future return in my present, daily thinking and life?$gs$, 4),
  ('19073062-9ad7-522c-adbc-89061f3e655e', 'fca33890-1adc-585c-8875-b15c6761b0a2', $gs$How does this future hope provide motivation for faithful endurance in a current difficulty I am experiencing?$gs$, 5),
  ('679f7f0d-6297-5f03-89e9-29c1652ccf48', 'fca33890-1adc-585c-8875-b15c6761b0a2', $gs$Have I ever used this future hope as an excuse for present withdrawal, rather than genuine, faithful engagement?$gs$, 6),
  ('dd4aa6e2-d3be-5da0-b517-1e5ffdaab606', 'fca33890-1adc-585c-8875-b15c6761b0a2', $gs$What would it look like to live with greater, present faithfulness because of this coming, promised reality?$gs$, 7),
  ('5e6fddb4-5ece-5bbd-b77a-5f2493460280', 'fca33890-1adc-585c-8875-b15c6761b0a2', $gs$How does anticipating “every eye” seeing Him shape how I think about my own, present witness and life?$gs$, 8)
on conflict (id) do nothing;
