  ('ff866f84-61f7-55c2-bd59-8fbf1b9eeebf', 'ceafd5e0-5294-5176-ba5f-8f63e98bf7b5', $gs$How has this entire study deepened both my understanding and my genuine, felt worship of who Christ actually is?$gs$, 5),
  ('f8ac968d-9bf3-5758-8193-a562ea0adac2', 'ceafd5e0-5294-5176-ba5f-8f63e98bf7b5', $gs$What specific truth from this plan has most moved me toward genuine, heartfelt worship?$gs$, 6),
  ('745ee938-6420-50cb-917f-7b3986de9fcc', 'ceafd5e0-5294-5176-ba5f-8f63e98bf7b5', $gs$How can I hold both understanding and feeling together in my ongoing worship, not settling for either alone?$gs$, 7),
