  ('07c43957-6f4e-5acb-8d15-8f7014462d58', 'f3bd9cc6-f59f-5572-9b2f-9c8140e33314', $gs$What has been the most significant truth I have learned about who Jesus Christ genuinely is throughout this study?$gs$, 5),
  ('a5bd5f62-eec6-58a6-aa2c-619547df6af1', 'f3bd9cc6-f59f-5572-9b2f-9c8140e33314', $gs$What specific practice from this plan do I want to carry forward as a lifelong habit of knowing Christ more deeply?$gs$, 6),
  ('774b4b23-85ba-5d8e-896b-61e30d237b7e', 'f3bd9cc6-f59f-5572-9b2f-9c8140e33314', $gs$What would it look like to still be growing in this knowledge decades from now, in every season of my life?$gs$, 7),
  ('00e2d33e-3265-517b-8b01-fe3b0226614c', 'f3bd9cc6-f59f-5572-9b2f-9c8140e33314', $gs$How has this study shaped your overall commitment to knowing and following Christ throughout your continuing journey?$gs$, 8)
on conflict (id) do nothing;
