  ('8bf87a04-c584-549f-a2d1-54b03af2b281', '0c3274c7-939c-5dac-baeb-f0d230bd52df', $gs$Have I confused mere intellectual agreement about Christ with this passage’s description of genuine, substantial trust?$gs$, 4),
  ('5c03f702-010f-5eca-abdb-277d5876f0f7', '0c3274c7-939c-5dac-baeb-f0d230bd52df', $gs$What is the difference, in my own experience, between believing facts about Jesus and actually trusting Him?$gs$, 5),
  ('2d2a2be0-6df1-5cc6-aa6e-0fab40123941', '0c3274c7-939c-5dac-baeb-f0d230bd52df', $gs$Do I currently have genuine, personal reliance on Christ’s completed work, or merely intellectual agreement?$gs$, 6),
  ('f41d6e1c-4e1c-51c8-9033-9d294aaff1f8', '0c3274c7-939c-5dac-baeb-f0d230bd52df', $gs$What remaining doubts do I have, and how does this lesson help me hold these alongside genuine, saving trust?$gs$, 7),
  ('e18c9aec-318d-583b-9e56-6ff884440b04', '0c3274c7-939c-5dac-baeb-f0d230bd52df', $gs$How would I explain the difference between mere belief and genuine, saving faith to someone else?$gs$, 8)
on conflict (id) do nothing;
