  ('bddff63c-723d-5102-b688-eb2a05e80f7e', '23de88d5-aa6f-5e7f-a5e6-b41ccdfcd6f2', $gs$Have I subtly added requirements — feeling, performance, improvement — to what should be faith alone?$gs$, 4),
  ('1047fc79-752a-5438-8eb8-17d060a4ba3f', '23de88d5-aa6f-5e7f-a5e6-b41ccdfcd6f2', $gs$How does this passage’s exclusive teaching provide freedom from any such subtle, added requirement?$gs$, 5),
  ('03c156c4-3c54-5ac9-b185-9a84fdf2e74c', '23de88d5-aa6f-5e7f-a5e6-b41ccdfcd6f2', $gs$What good works have I mistakenly treated as necessary additions to my justification, rather than its evidence?$gs$, 6),
  ('1dd04adf-7ed4-59a1-9972-e11631ff5ddd', '23de88d5-aa6f-5e7f-a5e6-b41ccdfcd6f2', $gs$How would I explain “faith alone” clearly to someone confused about the relationship between faith and works?$gs$, 7),
  ('992dda79-669d-5ec3-9aee-93360ef0ea8a', '23de88d5-aa6f-5e7f-a5e6-b41ccdfcd6f2', $gs$What confidence do I draw from resting in faith alone, without needing anything added to secure my standing?$gs$, 8)
on conflict (id) do nothing;
