  ('fb17ee89-50f4-5d7e-b660-6e376c816e21', '712789fb-2dc1-5124-880b-efee42a4447c', $gs$Have I confused generic, sincere spirituality with this passage’s call to genuine faith specifically in Christ?$gs$, 4),
  ('3d3c629a-b284-5d9d-b683-53f3b4cbc617', '712789fb-2dc1-5124-880b-efee42a4447c', $gs$How does understanding faith’s necessary, specific object change how I think about sincerity alone?$gs$, 5),
  ('1346af2a-3115-528c-a464-132caa86709c', '712789fb-2dc1-5124-880b-efee42a4447c', $gs$What would I say to someone who believes sincerity, regardless of its object, is what ultimately matters?$gs$, 6),
  ('75a64af8-e3ba-5e0f-906b-b596f485734c', '712789fb-2dc1-5124-880b-efee42a4447c', $gs$How does knowing Christ specifically as faith’s object provide confidence, rather than vague, undefined hope?$gs$, 7),
  ('626d450f-3ac4-5555-8cb5-e13a45e5b681', '712789fb-2dc1-5124-880b-efee42a4447c', $gs$How would I explain this specificity clearly and compassionately to someone practicing a different religion?$gs$, 8)
