  ('a5a1a1b8-3913-5325-a48b-adf9f6274d0c', '38b0b99b-4145-5817-9ff1-90cd77fef653', $gs$Was I honestly informed about potential cost when I first responded to the gospel, or only about its benefits?$gs$, 4),
  ('59957060-e8b5-54bf-964a-e3ec464b6bb3', '38b0b99b-4145-5817-9ff1-90cd77fef653', $gs$How does honest cost-counting protect against shallow decisions that might later be abandoned?$gs$, 5),
  ('8c92896b-8b60-5d15-8426-6f94787cb5e5', '38b0b99b-4145-5817-9ff1-90cd77fef653', $gs$What specific cost have I personally experienced as a result of following Christ?$gs$, 6),
  ('991052ba-9c64-5e97-bb0b-884aa199c96d', '38b0b99b-4145-5817-9ff1-90cd77fef653', $gs$How can I present the gospel honestly, including genuine cost, without discouraging genuine response?$gs$, 7),
  ('1897e4f1-14fa-5c2f-902f-99face9ed660', '38b0b99b-4145-5817-9ff1-90cd77fef653', $gs$What confidence do I draw from having honestly counted this cost and chosen to follow Christ anyway?$gs$, 8)
on conflict (id) do nothing;
