  ('4b92fb54-aa61-5a82-a930-c4e4171e411a', 'bf438b43-7905-5b94-b3c0-291bd3e2b9cb', $gs$If I have already prayed to receive Christ, what do I remember about that genuine, sincere moment?$gs$, 4),
  ('aff6537d-5c11-5654-a91e-4bdbc0d6acce', 'bf438b43-7905-5b94-b3c0-291bd3e2b9cb', $gs$If I have not yet responded, what is honestly holding me back from this simple, sincere prayer?$gs$, 5),
  ('1f116608-a34b-51f1-9b6f-3f8433fe4a6a', 'bf438b43-7905-5b94-b3c0-291bd3e2b9cb', $gs$Do I believe formal words or particular formulas matter more than genuine, honest sincerity?$gs$, 6),
  ('7679257c-748f-558c-bbc3-3c571ed4e745', 'bf438b43-7905-5b94-b3c0-291bd3e2b9cb', $gs$How would I help someone else who is ready to pray this kind of simple, sincere prayer of response?$gs$, 7),
  ('7ae3c7c8-ceeb-5159-aea7-a35d887bd17c', 'bf438b43-7905-5b94-b3c0-291bd3e2b9cb', $gs$What would I want to say to God right now, in my own words, regarding where I stand with Him?$gs$, 8)
on conflict (id) do nothing;
