  ('da911236-3d7a-5644-a682-417d253e5650', '5f01db1b-bad0-55e1-934c-b8d0400887fe', $gs$Have I told someone about my decision to follow Christ, or has this remained private, unshared information?$gs$, 4),
  ('056ebd31-6b48-5f1a-96c2-0a83b03b88db', '5f01db1b-bad0-55e1-934c-b8d0400887fe', $gs$What has kept me, if anything, from sharing this significant decision with someone I trust?$gs$, 5),
  ('08f0e370-5881-55c8-8798-a544acbe5909', '5f01db1b-bad0-55e1-934c-b8d0400887fe', $gs$Who is one specific, trusted person I could tell about my faith, if I have not already done so?$gs$, 6),
  ('35d5aa44-f414-54f9-aa37-b2ff14d5efd5', '5f01db1b-bad0-55e1-934c-b8d0400887fe', $gs$How might telling someone provide practical support and accountability for my continued growth?$gs$, 7),
  ('b42b4be7-b0f4-5d6f-bc4a-1a8f2259d3ea', '5f01db1b-bad0-55e1-934c-b8d0400887fe', $gs$What would it feel like to take this step of genuine, outward telling this week?$gs$, 8)
on conflict (id) do nothing;
