  ('f8d7e0c2-1abe-59ba-b0a2-009740e53b9a', 'd77baf10-0a2c-5c82-bebf-b2d4e7011b18', $gs$What has been the most significant truth I have learned about genuinely responding to this good news?$gs$, 5),
  ('c1dcde72-8a02-5c01-9638-59d1770e3ab1', 'd77baf10-0a2c-5c82-bebf-b2d4e7011b18', $gs$What specific practice from this plan do I want to carry forward as a lifelong habit of ongoing response?$gs$, 6),
  ('6b1e231d-ac4e-57a9-a1f5-fc65dce455cf', 'd77baf10-0a2c-5c82-bebf-b2d4e7011b18', $gs$What would it look like to still be genuinely responding, through repentance and faith, decades from now?$gs$, 7),
