  ('50c35b00-c532-589f-83f1-839c38cb4066', 'b02d9c47-fa95-536b-bc96-8918ca0c49b6', $gs$Have I based my assurance on my own, ongoing performance, rather than this passage’s completed, finished work?$gs$, 4),
  ('7d2cd8ee-c32e-5311-a8b0-5a6467f7c5cc', 'b02d9c47-fa95-536b-bc96-8918ca0c49b6', $gs$How does understanding Christ’s sacrifice as genuinely “once for all” provide stability amid my own, continued imperfection?$gs$, 5),
  ('b9ecea36-248f-5db3-a202-192a625858ac', 'b02d9c47-fa95-536b-bc96-8918ca0c49b6', $gs$What present struggle or failure have I mistakenly allowed to threaten my confidence in this finished work?$gs$, 6),
  ('330a634f-2253-50b8-a0e3-02c179b3cf40', 'b02d9c47-fa95-536b-bc96-8918ca0c49b6', $gs$How would I explain this stable foundation to someone who feels their salvation depends on their own performance?$gs$, 7),
  ('4240ecc6-b609-55cb-be29-92dd3cb23f95', 'b02d9c47-fa95-536b-bc96-8918ca0c49b6', $gs$What gratitude does this finished work produce in me as I consider my own, secure standing before God?$gs$, 8)
on conflict (id) do nothing;
