  ('5d3ed41c-3146-5518-99d9-a77a07846aec', '6ea34590-15e2-5c8e-b53e-612983a8ec0c', $gs$Have I noticed a genuine, even gradual, change in my own desire for God since coming to faith?$gs$, 4),
  ('1dc114ec-bd74-5027-9e61-e71266b8e2ec', '6ea34590-15e2-5c8e-b53e-612983a8ec0c', $gs$How does this changed desire differ from previous indifference or resistance I once felt toward spiritual things?$gs$, 5),
  ('76238b3a-bc1a-5cf9-b4fe-e513957d56db', '6ea34590-15e2-5c8e-b53e-612983a8ec0c', $gs$What specific evidence of this changed desire could I point to in my own, recent life and experience?$gs$, 6),
  ('527ef170-b19d-54dd-8010-3923d2dcd7c1', '6ea34590-15e2-5c8e-b53e-612983a8ec0c', $gs$How can I hold this evidence humbly, recognizing it as confirming, not the primary basis for my assurance?$gs$, 7),
  ('880151cb-85fd-54a6-be4a-2b729e615c0f', '6ea34590-15e2-5c8e-b53e-612983a8ec0c', $gs$What would I say to a new believer wondering whether they have experienced genuine change?$gs$, 8)
