  ('c8741d47-0985-58e1-a9ab-c42b7c48bb80', '634969f1-dfaa-5c30-8e2a-964a6ca12dff', $gs$What specific fruit of the Spirit have I noticed gradually, genuinely growing in my own life over time?$gs$, 5),
  ('1348a635-cfcd-5a26-a5d2-3252db4e2ff2', '634969f1-dfaa-5c30-8e2a-964a6ca12dff', $gs$Where do I still see genuine, honest incompleteness in this fruit, and how does this lesson help me hold that honestly?$gs$, 6),
  ('56c692c8-dab2-5df8-aae5-cdb2e175ab9d', '634969f1-dfaa-5c30-8e2a-964a6ca12dff', $gs$How can I patiently examine this evidence without either false confidence or unnecessary discouragement?$gs$, 7),
  ('d5651b5b-47d8-55e3-a2bf-8963cb83c324', '634969f1-dfaa-5c30-8e2a-964a6ca12dff', $gs$What would healthy, ongoing growth in this fruit look like for me in the coming months?$gs$, 8)
