  ('487cc515-aba7-5717-aaee-91635e1d35fe', '708a0bde-50bd-5033-9c4e-81994f7d581b', $gs$Have I compared my own, quieter journey to someone else’s more dramatic conversion or spiritual experience?$gs$, 4),
  ('dd335387-6745-5df2-8b69-207085e6060f', '708a0bde-50bd-5033-9c4e-81994f7d581b', $gs$What specific comparison currently threatens my confidence regarding my own, genuine relationship with Christ?$gs$, 5),
  ('309354f1-41cb-5536-b564-5fffbb28b2ee', '708a0bde-50bd-5033-9c4e-81994f7d581b', $gs$How does Jesus’s specific correction provide important perspective for redirecting my own focus and comparison?$gs$, 6),
  ('65aa8eb5-cae8-586d-ab9f-ce002834f768', '708a0bde-50bd-5033-9c4e-81994f7d581b', $gs$What would it look like to practice this redirection, following Jesus’s model, regarding a specific comparison?$gs$, 7),
  ('d4f1e103-73d0-5382-9773-96b4ba546407', '708a0bde-50bd-5033-9c4e-81994f7d581b', $gs$How can I find genuine encouragement in others’ testimonies without using them as my own standard of measurement?$gs$, 8)
