  ('07d54695-83e3-5b14-b724-021ceef7525c', 'e899da2f-3823-5c81-b995-5e9597d20596', $gs$Have I mistaken ongoing struggle with sin for evidence that my salvation is not genuine or has been lost?$gs$, 4),
  ('f6527d5f-542a-5d26-a0f8-df8514562568', 'e899da2f-3823-5c81-b995-5e9597d20596', $gs$How does Paul’s own, honest admission provide comfort and correct perspective for my own, similar struggle?$gs$, 5),
  ('5ac4e7ec-58dd-5971-8c67-1a17dafbee0f', 'e899da2f-3823-5c81-b995-5e9597d20596', $gs$What is the difference, in my own experience, between genuine struggle and comfortable, unrepentant continuance?$gs$, 6),
  ('c0697cf9-3cd8-5896-bb59-5a5464aaee0c', 'e899da2f-3823-5c81-b995-5e9597d20596', $gs$How can I hold genuine assurance alongside honest, ongoing repentance, not comfortable indifference toward sin?$gs$, 7),
  ('4961aef1-9d0e-5f88-95d2-28199b38bea3', 'e899da2f-3823-5c81-b995-5e9597d20596', $gs$What specific struggle could I bring honestly to God this week, trusting this passage’s comforting perspective?$gs$, 8)
