  ('c29590df-6b30-5ff1-bf4c-40ee1eda71ef', '73496f3d-0c65-5218-bf37-2cc94864ba9e', $gs$How does understanding God’s ongoing, empowering work change the anxiety I sometimes feel about my own progress?$gs$, 5),
  ('5c927714-fee8-5c60-91b6-f6364637698e', '73496f3d-0c65-5218-bf37-2cc94864ba9e', $gs$What would it look like to genuinely participate in my spiritual growth while resting confidently in God’s work?$gs$, 6),
  ('87c91f08-b117-570f-b8d1-2beb269f363c', '73496f3d-0c65-5218-bf37-2cc94864ba9e', $gs$How can I distinguish restful confidence from passive indifference in my own, daily spiritual practice?$gs$, 7),
