  ('38838f15-9dc7-5226-8de4-cfe7032215d4', '35cb6865-0ff9-57e7-85ec-2ccc87ab39a7', 'paragraph', $gs${"text":"Lesson Assignment\n\n1. Read Romans 15:4 and reflect on Scripture’s genuine purpose of comfort and hope.\n2. Identify three to five key verses on assurance from this study to keep as prepared resources.\n3. Write these verses somewhere accessible for future moments of doubt.\n4. Discuss with your peer guide how they use prepared Scripture during their own, difficult moments.\n5. Journal about your own, growing practice of returning to Scripture’s comfort during genuine doubt."}$gs$::jsonb, 7, false, false),
