  ('dcd1eaa4-e925-55ca-ba1e-2d171fb63f82', '9328d66a-ad45-5237-8437-e4a74d1006c2', $gs$What has been the most significant truth I have learned about resting confidently in my own, genuine salvation?$gs$, 5),
  ('1d616667-ff5f-5f32-8ca7-a9bf9d72d6f0', '9328d66a-ad45-5237-8437-e4a74d1006c2', $gs$What specific practice from this plan do I want to carry forward as a lifelong habit for settled confidence?$gs$, 6),
  ('7d8ae492-90b6-5c6b-a360-2668bfe3952e', '9328d66a-ad45-5237-8437-e4a74d1006c2', $gs$What would it look like to still carry this same, settled confidence decades from now, in every season of life?$gs$, 7),
  ('b7a72e08-5ec1-520e-8e9a-4de72d8e9b7d', '9328d66a-ad45-5237-8437-e4a74d1006c2', $gs$How has this study shaped your overall commitment to resting confidently in Christ throughout your continuing journey?$gs$, 8)
on conflict (id) do nothing;
