  ('58ec3646-4c5e-5659-8368-69bec51cbbf6', '65dd1cb7-90cc-5431-a959-28a240ca42ec', $gs$Have I understood baptism as vague, generic ritual, rather than this passage’s vivid, specific picture of death and resurrection?$gs$, 4),
  ('b82013a6-67e5-5bec-9e80-4e7ecb7cdfd5', '65dd1cb7-90cc-5431-a959-28a240ca42ec', $gs$How does this imagery deepen my appreciation for what baptism actually, meaningfully portrays?$gs$, 5),
  ('8bb4edbb-9c9d-5b51-a4f7-0e003fa73262', '65dd1cb7-90cc-5431-a959-28a240ca42ec', $gs$What does “walking in newness of life” mean to me practically, following this pictured death and resurrection?$gs$, 6),
  ('2b124146-39a5-54f7-96eb-554c48fbfc0c', '65dd1cb7-90cc-5431-a959-28a240ca42ec', $gs$How would I explain this specific imagery to someone unfamiliar with baptism’s genuine, biblical meaning?$gs$, 7),
  ('450a560f-6d3c-5262-9637-0b46c866fd53', '65dd1cb7-90cc-5431-a959-28a240ca42ec', $gs$What emotions arise as I consider this vivid picture, whether anticipating or remembering my own baptism?$gs$, 8)
