  ('5d8e1928-1763-5b5f-acc8-043d955dcf8a', 'e2f299b0-566c-512c-bdbd-d2359aebab8c', $gs$Have I considered Jesus’s own baptism as meaningful example, or overlooked this significant aspect of His ministry?$gs$, 4),
  ('448bd0cf-5a12-5287-a06d-a032412f60c3', 'e2f299b0-566c-512c-bdbd-d2359aebab8c', $gs$How does understanding His baptism as identification with humanity deepen my appreciation for His genuine humility?$gs$, 5),
  ('da989baa-2002-5594-850d-da4358b39195', 'e2f299b0-566c-512c-bdbd-d2359aebab8c', $gs$What does it mean to me that Christ Himself modeled this same act I am called to follow?$gs$, 6),
  ('9aa99e55-2092-544b-af5a-ca7401b3545f', 'e2f299b0-566c-512c-bdbd-d2359aebab8c', $gs$How does this example shape my own motivation for pursuing or having pursued baptism myself?$gs$, 7),
  ('5ebcce87-82e6-58b3-a12d-d2231bddf440', 'e2f299b0-566c-512c-bdbd-d2359aebab8c', $gs$What questions do I still have about the specific differences between Christ’s baptism and my own?$gs$, 8)
on conflict (id) do nothing;
