  ('70b965eb-6fa5-5eb0-8605-d8b3d872a76f', '30034dc6-bd02-5fd8-ae0d-df3aa40b9d07', $gs$Have I delayed baptism significantly beyond my genuine profession of faith, and if so, what has caused this delay?$gs$, 4),
  ('72b49186-33eb-5c54-ae65-e82345803a40', '30034dc6-bd02-5fd8-ae0d-df3aa40b9d07', $gs$How does this passage’s consistent pattern throughout Acts shape my own sense of appropriate timing?$gs$, 5),
  ('020b1e8f-269c-5797-b2cc-499f80ed3291', '30034dc6-bd02-5fd8-ae0d-df3aa40b9d07', $gs$What preparation, if any, do I still feel I need before pursuing this step, and is this preparation genuinely necessary?$gs$, 6),
  ('a592208c-8901-5a52-be0e-2e44853156a6', '30034dc6-bd02-5fd8-ae0d-df3aa40b9d07', $gs$How would I encourage a new believer to pursue baptism promptly, following this passage’s consistent, biblical pattern?$gs$, 7),
