  ('75d8bab3-5fba-5d74-85c4-062d4e2eeb1e', '1b3515d6-130c-5553-b152-213bf7ea3bf3', $gs$How does understanding this corporate identification shape my own desire to pursue baptism within church community?$gs$, 5),
  ('dd540b73-1666-5d51-b0a8-a516674edbf5', '1b3515d6-130c-5553-b152-213bf7ea3bf3', $gs$What specific local church community could I pursue or strengthen connection to as I consider this step?$gs$, 6),
  ('b982d990-6ea1-51ad-832e-b7f499998eca', '1b3515d6-130c-5553-b152-213bf7ea3bf3', $gs$How does this passage’s teaching deepen my appreciation for belonging to Christ’s broader, gathered people?$gs$, 7),
