  ('c67a18b4-3750-5a7c-b50a-16a15bc0f701', 'abe2fc6f-441c-55d9-99e8-31ce0906f176', $gs$What genuine gratitude and anticipation could I cultivate as I prepare for or remember my own baptism?$gs$, 5),
  ('5285ce20-e752-5ec4-93a0-26733c95a7dc', 'abe2fc6f-441c-55d9-99e8-31ce0906f176', $gs$How does John’s own humility provide helpful perspective for my own approach to this significant step?$gs$, 6),
  ('e2c6b891-3f68-5ddf-b7b4-bf2d860b52c9', 'abe2fc6f-441c-55d9-99e8-31ce0906f176', $gs$What would it look like to prepare for this step with thoughtful reverence, not anxious perfectionism?$gs$, 7),
