  ('89de3955-f80b-5900-910f-de5a914d8db0', 'fb553af1-43d8-5c09-bceb-0645f0da0516', $gs$Have I thoughtfully considered who I would want to invite to witness my own baptism, or has this remained unconsidered?$gs$, 4),
  ('00fa4866-b402-5b8f-ab7a-37605c2331da', 'fb553af1-43d8-5c09-bceb-0645f0da0516', $gs$Who in my life might be particularly meaningful to have present — family, friends, mentors — at this event?$gs$, 5),
  ('1ac8abf0-0993-53cd-acce-2b3d1c8e783b', 'fb553af1-43d8-5c09-bceb-0645f0da0516', $gs$Is there someone who does not yet know Christ whose presence might provide meaningful gospel testimony?$gs$, 6),
  ('8027b969-fb83-5902-b156-71249c385a2e', 'fb553af1-43d8-5c09-bceb-0645f0da0516', $gs$What would it mean to me personally to have these specific people present for this significant step?$gs$, 7),
  ('e2db8732-3f44-5fb0-b13f-4ab62c4d50ae', 'fb553af1-43d8-5c09-bceb-0645f0da0516', $gs$How can I extend this invitation thoughtfully and intentionally in the coming weeks?$gs$, 8)
on conflict (id) do nothing;
