  ('c0f7d662-c740-5769-96a5-abaf53e17305', '6650ff12-2106-5dc0-a7db-056dd1b4b19a', $gs$Have I drawn on the truth of my baptism — my old self genuinely crucified — during moments of temptation?$gs$, 4),
  ('d9e37c4a-4335-5d91-82b8-0d1ccf7daf32', '6650ff12-2106-5dc0-a7db-056dd1b4b19a', $gs$How might remembering this specific, accomplished reality provide practical help the next time I face temptation?$gs$, 5),
  ('70579ca7-858e-5b07-8948-621ea391c29c', '6650ff12-2106-5dc0-a7db-056dd1b4b19a', $gs$What genuine temptation am I currently facing where this truth could provide meaningful, practical support?$gs$, 6),
  ('856d73f4-a199-5791-8c8d-3c0f3fe8b5a2', '6650ff12-2106-5dc0-a7db-056dd1b4b19a', $gs$How can I develop this specific habit of remembering my baptism as part of my broader resistance to temptation?$gs$, 7),
  ('3075acca-2897-58ac-8971-e510e4f36ae6', '6650ff12-2106-5dc0-a7db-056dd1b4b19a', $gs$What would it look like to draw on this truth intentionally the next time I experience genuine, significant temptation?$gs$, 8)
on conflict (id) do nothing;
