  ('23796fdb-94b2-5a76-af08-08a9bde7a4b3', 'e5dbb24a-1245-5208-bfb2-070231ae2589', $gs$How has my understanding of baptism — its meaning, biblical pattern, practical preparation — changed through this study?$gs$, 4),
  ('6e277958-6e1f-5266-b8b5-39dc9c11f7e4', 'e5dbb24a-1245-5208-bfb2-070231ae2589', $gs$What has been the most significant truth I have learned about this significant, public step of obedience?$gs$, 5),
  ('ea4cd2e5-f0ed-58bb-8cb3-e7347be5c9b2', 'e5dbb24a-1245-5208-bfb2-070231ae2589', $gs$What specific practice from this plan do I want to carry forward as a lifelong habit of walking in newness of life?$gs$, 6),
  ('79d920d1-fd99-57a4-97ab-6047488b64a0', 'e5dbb24a-1245-5208-bfb2-070231ae2589', $gs$What would it look like to still be living out this identification decades from now, in every season of my life?$gs$, 7),
  ('73b6501f-ceb3-51c3-9209-ba982a1fe13d', 'e5dbb24a-1245-5208-bfb2-070231ae2589', $gs$How has this study shaped your overall commitment to Christ throughout your continuing faith and obedience?$gs$, 8)
on conflict (id) do nothing;
