  ('96091b99-95e4-59a8-a868-1e923a6ef35e', 'ca6741b0-ce37-5e3e-869f-b31a9dbe145e', $gs$How does understanding “disciple” as ongoing learner reshape my expectation for what my Christian life actually involves?$gs$, 6),
  ('6babbe9f-4ce6-57e1-b6f5-d530a7b9d2e7', 'ca6741b0-ce37-5e3e-869f-b31a9dbe145e', $gs$What specific area of ongoing learning do I sense I need to grow in right now?$gs$, 7),
  ('f70f08a2-594a-51dc-a3e8-4f62a4d51398', 'ca6741b0-ce37-5e3e-869f-b31a9dbe145e', $gs$How can I move from treating conversion as a finish line toward embracing this ongoing, lifelong journey?$gs$, 8)
