  ('e21df2fe-7502-5462-b777-a441f0d967a8', '2fa98eab-67b0-5353-95a0-b97bc4cb491d', $gs$What relationship or priority in my own life sometimes competes with genuine, comprehensive commitment to Christ?$gs$, 5),
  ('af5eb0a2-2bbf-56e6-a384-f33438088174', '2fa98eab-67b0-5353-95a0-b97bc4cb491d', $gs$How does understanding this passage’s intentional hyperbole help me correctly interpret its genuine, intended meaning?$gs$, 6),
  ('a61e9818-1005-501f-b336-9e9b1ab6a8d9', '2fa98eab-67b0-5353-95a0-b97bc4cb491d', $gs$What would it look like to hold Christ as genuinely first, without this requiring literal neglect of family relationships?$gs$, 7),
