  ('78c08da5-bece-5d7c-8c4f-0c371fa901df', 'bf8d8cdd-9c1a-52fd-8aa4-9c996529155e', $gs$What has held me back, if anything, from actively seeking this kind of mentoring relationship?$gs$, 5),
  ('98c7ca2a-3ac3-576b-9c88-3f135ffc4e84', 'bf8d8cdd-9c1a-52fd-8aa4-9c996529155e', $gs$What specific qualities would I want in a mentor, and where might I find someone with these qualities?$gs$, 6),
  ('f4a95c35-eeeb-5a49-ab99-43f29d928a3e', 'bf8d8cdd-9c1a-52fd-8aa4-9c996529155e', $gs$Am I willing to be honest and vulnerable with a mentor, not merely seeking answers from a comfortable distance?$gs$, 7),
  ('8b2b37e8-cccf-5732-b06f-b408a912fe69', 'bf8d8cdd-9c1a-52fd-8aa4-9c996529155e', $gs$Who in my church community might be a good person to approach about this kind of relationship?$gs$, 8)
