  ('af2b636a-7c1f-563f-9b4f-478d3d6f603b', 'f810a9b6-eb5a-50d7-aba9-f4481ffd4fa6', $gs$Have I assumed I must achieve complete maturity before I can invest in someone else’s growth?$gs$, 4),
  ('6def0004-f44f-5f04-87f4-2b38a1769bfa', 'f810a9b6-eb5a-50d7-aba9-f4481ffd4fa6', $gs$Who in my life might benefit from this kind of intentional investment, even at my own, current stage of growth?$gs$, 5),
  ('c90758ee-b501-51de-9bc2-3371a58e757e', 'f810a9b6-eb5a-50d7-aba9-f4481ffd4fa6', $gs$What specific insight or experience from my own journey could I share to help someone else grow?$gs$, 6),
  ('9b0c1284-0d81-5f1a-897e-7bfd895d1753', 'f810a9b6-eb5a-50d7-aba9-f4481ffd4fa6', $gs$How does this passage’s multi-generational vision challenge any passivity I have felt about investing in others?$gs$, 7),
  ('be3cde0c-a69b-52ca-b141-af2154da8d6d', 'f810a9b6-eb5a-50d7-aba9-f4481ffd4fa6', $gs$What would it look like to begin this kind of intentional investment in someone else this month?$gs$, 8)
on conflict (id) do nothing;
